    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mason Estates are delighted to present this 2 bedroom semi-detached home, situated in this mature residential location in the heart of Killester.\n\nAccommodation briefly consists of an entrance hall, sitting room to the front with a kitchen and dining room to the rear. Upstairs there are two double bedrooms and bathroom. \n\nThe property has double glazed uPVC windows, however it will require modernisation throughout but offers huge potential to prospective purchasers. There is a walled garden to the front with a side entrance giving access to a private rear garden. \n\nKillester Village and DART station are just a 5-minute walk away and there are a range of schools, shops and restaurants close by. \n\nOUTSIDE: \nWalled and railed garden to the front with side entrance leading to a private walled and hedged rear garden \n\nGENERAL POINTS, SERVICES & UTILITIES: \n•BER is G. BER Number 119678688\n•Double glazed windows throughout.\n\nNEGOTIATOR:\nSIOBHAN FOLEY MSCSI MRICS - PHIBSBORO OFFICE (01) 8304000\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ENTRANCE HALL\nWith understair storage, electric storage heater.\n\nSITTING ROOM: 3.0m x 2.7m\nLocated to the front of the property with original timber floor, tiled fireplace with open coal fire,\n\nKITCHEN 3.4m x 1.9m\nSome fitted floor and wall units, stainless steel sink, door to rear garden.\n\nDINING ROOM: 3.4m x 2.9m\nLocated to the rear of the property with original timber floor, tiled fireplace with open coal fire, electric storage heater.\n\nUPSTAIRS:\n\nBEDROOM 1: 4.9m x 3.4m (max measurements)\nDouble bedroom to the front of the property with original timber floor and original fireplace.\n\nBEDROOM 2: 3.3m x 2.8m\nDouble bedroom to the rear of the property with original timber floor.\n\nBATHROOM: 1.9m x 1.5m\nBath and w.c.\n\nTOTAL FLOOR AREA:\nc. 61 sqm.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Fine two-bedroom home. </li><li> Offering huge potential to add your own flair and design. </li><li> Private rear garden </li><li> Killester Village and St Annes Park within walking distance. </li><li> Killester Dart Station is approximately 5 min walk. </li><li> Good transport links to the City Centre </li><li> Within easy reach of Beaumont Hospital </li><li> Within a stroll of Artane Castle Shopping centre.</li></ul>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: G<br>BER No: 119678688<br>Energy Performance Indicator: 873.39 kWh/m2/yr"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Travelling from Fairview take the Malahide Road and out past Collins Avenue pass Mayfield Park taking the next right onto Killester Avenue. Follow the road to the next bend and no. 168 is on the right-hand side."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Siobhan Foley"
      }
